, which would need to be added in\n\n## Testicles\n\n- Testicles have two style options: Pair and Sheath\n- Each style has two sets of coloring options: Greyscale and Skintone (_s)\n- Testicle sizes go from 0 to 8\n- Testicle sprites mainly use ADJ sprites, but it\'s appreciated to add BEHIND sprites where necessary.\n- Testicle sprites also have taur alts, which would need to be added in\n\n## Vagina\n\n- Vaginas have 8 styles: Human, Tentacle, Dentata, Hairy, Spade, Furred, Gaping, Cloaca\n- Each style has an aroused and not aroused state\n- They only hav\n\nRate the following (1-10 each):\n- Clarity: How clear is the requirement?\n- Solvability: Can this be solved with code changes alone (no human design decisions)?\n- Scope: Is this small enough to solve in <2 hours of coding?\n\nIf all three scores are >= 7, suggest a brief implementation approach (2-3 sentences).\n\nRespond in JSON:\n{"clarity": N, "solvability": N, "scope": N, "feasible": true/false, "approach": "...", "reason": "..."}'}], 'model': 'nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b', 'max_tokens': 500, 'temperature': 0.2}}
