ensive Analysis:** Carry out an in-depth study of the existing Qortal architecture to identify potential bottlenecks and areas that require improvement.\r\n2. **Develop Scalability Strategies:** Create methods to enhance block propagation and synchronization, thereby reducing latency and boosting network efficiency.\r\n3. **Implement Optimization Techniques:** Deploy advanced caching mechanisms and database optimizations to improve overall performance and diminish response times.\r\n4. **Perform Rigorous Testing:** Conduct meticulous testing and benchmark\n\nRate the following (1-10 each):\n- Clarity: How clear is the requirement?\n- Solvability: Can this be solved with code changes alone (no human design decisions)?\n- Scope: Is this small enough to solve in <2 hours of coding?\n\nIf all three scores are >= 7, suggest a brief implementation approach (2-3 sentences).\n\nRespond in JSON:\n{"clarity": N, "solvability": N, "scope": N, "feasible": true/false, "approach": "...", "reason": "..."}'}], 'model': 'nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b', 'max_tokens': 500, 'temperature': 0.2}}
